# Shree Satguru Enterprises — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to a local config (see README.md Step 8) and fill in
# your own Supabase project values. NEVER commit real values, and
# NEVER put the Service Role Key or any password here.

SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-SUPABASE-ANON-KEY

# Do NOT add:
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY  (server-only, never expose to a browser)
# Owner password (never stored in code — set via Supabase Auth)
